# Route: guide 49 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 76 quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Dustwallow Marsh, Hillsbrad Foothills, Badlands, Ironforge, Arathi
# Highlands, Stormwind City, Swamp of Sorrows, Blasted Lands, Stranglethorn
# Vale, Feralas, Tanaris): Theramore Isle -> The Quagmire -> Theramore Isle ->
# Brackenwall Village -> Theramore Isle -> The Den of Flame -> Theramore Isle
# -> The Den of Flame -> Theramore Isle -> The Quagmire -> Southshore ->
# Darrow Hill -> Hammertoe's Digsite -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Star, the Hand and the Heart
# (735; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44);
# Shadowshard Fragments (7070; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard Smasher
# 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer 38); Crushridge Warmongers (504; Crushridge
# Warmonger 39-40); Summoning the Princess (656; Myzrael 44); An Ambassador of
# Evil (762; Ambassador Infernus 42).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Tiara of the Deep (2846), In the Name of the Light (1053),
# Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), Kibler's Exotic Pets (4729), En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why
# (4862), Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the Deeps (971),
# Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050), The Lost
# Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace
# (2204), The Lost Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924), Essential
# Artificials (2924), The Grand Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal (2929),
# Data Rescue (2930), Data Rescue (2930), Kharan Mighthammer (4341), The Fate
